{
  "slug": "testing",
  "name": "Testing",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Kobiton brings agentic AI to mobile quality so engineers & testers can initiate testing directly from where code is built. With our Claude Code plugin, you can initiate Appium tests and inspect results on real devices without leaving your development workflow.\n\nYou can manage test execution, save apps for future testing, review test execution results, work with a range of different real devices.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 commands**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `create-test-run` (Create a Kobiton test run from a test case or suite, then offer to monitor it), `drive-automation-session` (Drive an already-reserved Kobiton device from a natural-language intent), `monitor-test-run` (Watch a running Kobiton test run and narrate it to the user: read the org's live-remediation flag up…), `run-automation-suite` (Run local Appium test scripts against Kobiton devices), `run-interactive-session` (Perform interactive testing on Kobiton devices using natural language)\n- **Commands** (2): `doctor` (Run read-only health checks on the Kobiton automate plugin (CLI, credentials, profile)), `setup` (Fetch Kobiton credentials from the authenticated MCP server and write them to ~/.kobiton/.credentials)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `kobiton`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install testing@claude-community` from `kobiton/automate`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
